# Notes on FX1 duck the signal sidechain-style: a pump on every beat, deeper with higher velocity, held for the note.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track fx1
input noise 0.3
param p1 48
param p2 64
param pan 128
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 C4 1 127
note 4 C4 1 100
note 8 C4 2 127
note 12 C4 1 60
note 16 C4 1 127
note 20 E4 1 127
note 20 G4 1 40
note 24 C4 4 127
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below -0.1
